-- Termination control. A self-referential or mutually referential local binding
-- cannot be substituted — the substitution would not terminate — so the pass
-- must detect the cycle, leave the binding opaque, and finish.
--
-- If this file ever hangs the suite, that is the regression.

GIVEN m IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `self referential` IF
    loop
    WHERE
        loop MEANS loop AND m

GIVEN m IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `mutually referential` IF
    ping
    WHERE
        ping MEANS pong AND m
        pong MEANS ping OR m
